.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.local

# Editor and agent settings, specific to one machine: the launch configuration
# holds an absolute path, so it is of no use to anyone else and only leaks the
# shape of somebody's disk.
.claude/

# Google hands you this when you create an OAuth client. It holds a real
# client_secret, which this app never uses and must never publish — the browser
# token flow has nowhere to keep one. Keep the file out of the repository
# entirely; the only value needed from it is the client id, which lives in
# src/config.js.
client_secret*.json
